    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d345">

                <pb facs="0434" n="422" xml:id="pg422"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.0090/138e: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-05-20">May 20, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1298. American interests—Japan. Department’s 1234, May 13, paragraph 2. Japanese
                    Government should be informed that charter for <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gripsholm</hi> has been signed and it is expected that vessel will leave
                    New York June 9 and arrive Lourenço Marques July 6 calling at Rio de
                    Janeiro.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
